    "detailed_description": "Cursed Cove is an exciting 3D strategic game where players immerse themselves in a dark world of pirates and necromancy.<br />\r\nYour task is to capture the enemy tower using an army of skeletons that you can summon. <br />\r\nStrategically position your skeletons to attack the tower's cannons and archers, breaking through defensive lines and moving closer to victory. <br />\r\nEach level offers new challenges and opportunities to improve your necromancer skills. Are you ready to raise the black flag and embark on conquest?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n3D Graphics<br />\r\nStrategic Planning<br />\r\nVariety of Skeletons",
